# Invasion Submersible: Bot2 answers the exhaust ability with Brazen Borrower's Petty Theft, returning the Vehicle to Bot1's hand. The
# ability resolves without a Vehicle to act on (CR 400.7: the card in the hand is a new object), so no counters and no creature.
# The recast Submersible is a new object too (the exhaust ruling): its exhaust ability can be activated again, once more, and then
# makes a 3/3 artifact creature. The Moxen tapped for waterbend (Convoke:) are the artifacts that pay.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Invasion Submersible
Mox Pearl
